<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.button_group.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>ButtonGroup 是 gpui-component 按钮组容器组件的 RML 封装。容器模式，子节点为 Button 组件。</p>
            <p>用于将多个相关操作按钮分组展示，提供视觉一致性。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>包裹多个 Button 子节点，组合为操作分组。</p>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="上一步" />
                <Button label="下一步" primary="" />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="操作分组">
            <p>用于对齐排列的操作按钮。</p>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="保存" primary="" />
                <Button label="取消" ghost="" />
                <Button label="删除" danger="" />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态按钮(if 条件渲染)">
            <p>点击按钮增减 Button 数量,观察 ButtonGroup 实时变化(演示 if 条件渲染):</p>
            <p>当前按钮数: {button_count}</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="添加按钮" primary="" on-click={on_add_button} />
                <Button label="移除按钮" on-click={on_remove_button} />
            </div>
            <ButtonGroup>
                <Button label="按钮 1" if={button_count >= 1} />
                <Button label="按钮 2" primary="" if={button_count >= 2} />
                <Button label="按钮 3" ghost="" if={button_count >= 3} />
                <Button label="按钮 4" danger="" if={button_count >= 4} />
                <Button label="按钮 5" warning="" if={button_count >= 5} />
            </ButtonGroup>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
